Package: stagemap
Title: Relation Maps for 'Shiny' and 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "analyticswithharsh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Draws relation maps: things placed by stage and lane, joined by
    links whose kind sets their style, with functions that trace and check
    the map. In early development: the package holds a placeholder function
    while the real functions are designed.
